This patent is related to U.S. patent application Ser. No. 10/348,077, entitled “Method and System for Obtaining Logical Performance Data[ for] a Circuit in a Data Network[,]” filed Jan[.][ 21], 2003, and U.S. patent application Ser. No. 10/348,592, entitled “Method and System for Provision

